recommendationid": "42050200", "author": {"steamid": "76561198386455905", "personaname": "黄呱呱", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198386455905/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3759, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 409, "last_played": 1613067146, "avatar": "148ff422f2245ab66abfeabf3f7506861d6b703b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "首先不得不说这是一款好游戏，无论是画风和游戏细节我个人认为是无可挑剔的。这个游戏适合4人开黑玩真的特别有意思，队友互相帮助游戏体验极佳。\n我个人认为这个游戏还有值得改进的地方。\n-1、可以加入氧气系统，出仓就会开始慢慢消耗氧气，在玩家跑动时会加大氧气的消耗。\n-2、加入电池系统，开启前照灯会消耗电池。电池消耗完无法开启前照灯和探测器设备。\n-3、补给里会有氧气包和电池可供补给和更换。\n目前也就想到了这几个增加游戏乐趣和难点的点。希望得到回复。", "timestamp_created": 1526388644, "timestamp_updated": 1526388644, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50205761194229126", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42047970", "author": {"steamid": "76561198198903257", "personaname": "情源源", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198198903257/", "num_games_owned": 160, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1620, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1189, "last_played": 1719207035, "avatar": "8d5aecf456aa5cefd6afd58d42985e64363ca954"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "工头叫你去挖矿了！！！！个人十分喜欢这种类型游戏 只是现阶段游戏内容有点骚?（少）  希望更新多点内容和dlc", "timestamp_created": 1526375579, "timestamp_updated": 1526375579, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42047405", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135830020", "perso